{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0343_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3a8ddadf12f140cb4261f2f8855c8db29e61527361f9b0eed4650e9d6a608718", "ja": "（『☆ピコピコプラネット☆』の特別番組は大好評！\nまたいつか、みんなで集まれたらいいな……）", "zh": "（《☆噼啪噼啪星球☆》的特别节目大受好评！\n要是哪天还能再和大家聚在一起就好了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0343_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "0e2f18040aef0a967fd75918e26dba73eb9c7c5ac19e8c2a8cca8dbf1207311e", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nちょっとだけ……お話ししても、いい……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n稍微……聊一会儿，也可以吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0343_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b1ca2469153a46849f80fb7ad12d6e33ccbd8f44a8f861726bdb85cfbcdc0ae0", "ja": "お、杏奈。お疲れさま。\n構わないけど、何かあったか？", "zh": "哦，杏奈。辛苦了。\n可以啊，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0343_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "293f8c89d5cf494db78baad3a57caa086d2897ac958e708e192320dc5d74db3d", "ja": "ん……。あのね……この間の番組で……\n子どもたちと、久しぶりに会ったでしょ？", "zh": "嗯……那个……之前的节目里……\n不是和孩子们久违地见面了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0343_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "dc1311cbb84b7063d5f373681512f0eb56874cd35852f482fe779c63e2694124", "ja": "みんな、いろんなもの、\n『せーふく』できて、すごいなって……。", "zh": "大家“征服”了\n各种各样的事物，真的很厉害呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0343_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b672e726c9ab3c3f850150fca5554cab55dcb9f82d4718edd0e763fc0c7cb8f1", "ja": "そうだな。子ども達の成長ぶりには\n驚かされたよ。みんな努力しててえらいよな。", "zh": "是啊。孩子们的成长真是让人惊讶。大家都很努力，真了不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0343_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "bf03851e72f97e4b0a2970f5861cd1b49a982bedbcb990a00641596c10b93141", "ja": "うん……。だから杏奈も、\nなにか、もっと『せーふく』したい……。", "zh": "嗯……所以杏奈也想再多“征服”些什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0343_1007_p", "source_sha256": "cefdc1f855d5d3b0848a921289fe26722b2b61b726e032f71dc12deb17ef16ba", "ja": "なにかって、たとえばどんな事？", "zh": "你说的是什么事？比如说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0343_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "444595c12619364ddb081d2d94734555b8b772d65a4704bf539bf7e71008b065", "ja": "ん……。杏奈、普通にお話しするの、苦手だから……。\nお話……もっとうまくなりたい、です……。", "zh": "嗯……因为杏奈不擅长……普通地跟人聊天……\n想要……变得更擅长跟人说话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0343_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "7b69847c6e38b63b81176acf52dfc2a6304a23fc18b42f2d578afe3d72d79cca", "ja": "でも……どうすれば、うまくなるか、\nわからなくて……。", "zh": "但是……我不知道该怎么做，才能变得更擅长……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0343_1010_p", "source_sha256": "70882a8c25a5b6f05e16e4bf0a1dcc3dfccf452618f74fd04219d0b08da1ff65", "ja": "そうだな……。やっぱり話す機会を\nたくさん作るっていうのが一番かな。", "zh": "是啊……果然还是尽量多创造交流的机会，最重要吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0343_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "9752c62dbd73376443b9e027f504bf33bdc1fe03c467b479778cd25f11a5cc15", "ja": "話す機会……。それって、\nお仕事でも……いい、のかな……？", "zh": "说话的机会……。工作上的……也……可以，吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0343_1012_p", "source_sha256": "74baa63e8bb999934d785d87d69113c020686d7bf6b8e0a2f22b842deb6cfba9", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。トークがメインの仕事とか\nいいんじゃないか？　バラエティとか、司会とかな。", "zh": "啊，当然了。以谈话为主的工作不也挺好吗？比如综艺节目、主持之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0343_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "af4c06c695b81d077016a605f7be6fabc69914a85b5562dd30600bad1fb96dcd", "ja": "杏奈、ちゃんとできるか、わからないけど……。\nもっと、がんばってみたい……。", "zh": "杏奈也不知道自己能不能做好……但想再努力试试看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0343_1014_p", "source_sha256": "b3b09503874b1ae23346ed1d20d7688b2c44dc9fa13165d0aa63acd00ff913da", "ja": "ああ、一緒に頑張ろう！　杏奈の『せーふく』が\n上手くいくように、全力でサポートするよ。", "zh": "啊，一起努力吧！为了让杏奈的『征服』顺利进行，我会全力支持你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0343_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "4e8499f030d0952f842dc7957039d1aebef886acb09a1d33318d4defd2887e10", "ja": "うん……。ありがと……。\n{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "嗯……谢谢你……\n{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0343_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "f7c4555ce87ac075191a984d6879cdbb4ffcba5d902be3e39b6fcaf662cca2b5", "ja": "杏奈、子どもたちに、負けないくらい……\n成長するから……これからも、見てて、ね……♪", "zh": "杏奈会成长到不输给孩子们的……今后也要继续看着杏奈哦……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
